		border-radius: 32rpx;
		background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.settings-btn-hover {
		background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
	}

